 mdzes ldan chen po\u02bci rgyud -- (ga)kun tu bzang po thugs kyi me long gi rgyud -- (nga)sgron ma \u02bcbar ba\u02bci rgyud -- (ca)rdo rje sems dpa\u02bc snying gi le long gi rgyud -- Pod gnyis pa. (2) -- (cha)rig pa rang shar chen po\u02bci rgyud -- (ja)nor bu phra bkod rang gi don thams cad gsal bar byed pa\u02bci rgyud -- (nya)ngo sprod rin po che spras pa\u02bci zhing khams bstan pa\u02bci rgyud -- Pod gsum pa. (3) -- (ta)kun tu bzang po klong drug pa\u02bci rgyud -- (tha)yi ge med pa\u02bci rgyud chen po -- (da)seng ge rtsal rdzogs chen po\u02bci rgyud -- (na)mu tig rin po che phreng ba\u02bci rgyud -- (pa)rig pa rang grol chen po thams can \u02bcgrol ba\u02bci rgyud -- (pha)rin chen spungs pa yon tan chen po ston pa rgyud kyi rgyal po -- (ba)dpal nam mkha\u02bc med pa\u02bci sku gdung \u02bcbar ba chen po\u02bci rgyud -- Pod bzhi pa. (4) -- (ma)nyi ma dang zla ba kha sbyor ba chen po gsang ba\u02bci rgyud -- (tsa)sku thams cad kyi snang ba ston pa dbang rdzogs pa rang byung chen po\u02bci rgyud -- (tsha)bka\u02bc srung nag mo\u02bci rgyud -- (dza)rgyud kyi khog snying sdeb pa","Description based on online resource (BDRC, viewed May 5, 2022)"],"associated-names":"Buddhist Digital Resource Center","identifier-access":"http://archive.org/details/bdrc-W1KG11703","identifier-ark":"ark:/13960/t4pk7jk77","imagecount":"390","foldoutcount":"0","backup_location":"ia906801_5","access-restricted-item":"true","page_number_confidence":"5.49","cdl":"yes","geo_restricted":"CN","ocr":"tesseract 5.0.0-1-g862e","ocr_parameters":"-l bod","ocr_module_version":"0.0.15","ocr_detected_script":"Bengali","ocr_detected_script_conf":"0.6724","ocr_detected_lang":"dz","ocr_detected_lang_conf":"1.0000","pdf_module_version":"0.0.18"},"server":"ia802802.us.archive.org","uniq":1184152537,"workable_servers":["ia802802.us.archive.org","ia902802.us.archive.org"]}